# BrockDJ — Cursor Agent Rules

## Memory Bank (required every task)

Before starting any task, read these files in order:

1. `.cursor/memory/projectbrief.md` — goals and scope
2. `.cursor/memory/techContext.md` — stack, architecture, conventions
3. `.cursor/memory/activeContext.md` — current work and decisions
4. `.cursor/memory/progress.md` — done / in progress / known issues

After completing meaningful work, update:

- **`activeContext.md`** — current task, root cause, approach, next steps
- **`progress.md`** — check off completed items, add new known issues

Keep updates concise and factual. Do not duplicate full code in memory files.

## Project conventions

- **Platform priority:** Linux > Apple Silicon Mac > Intel Mac > Windows
- **C++26**, minimal diffs, match existing naming and file layout
- **Mixer QML → audio:** use context property `mixerControl` (created before QML load), not nested `engine.*` from inline components
- **Crossfader / volume:** `mixerControl.syncCrossfaderState` + `mixerControl.applyAllVolumes`; fader changes via `mixerControl.setChannelFader`
- **MIDI sync:** `parameterStore` + `MixerParameterBridge` / `MidiFlx10Bridge`
- Do not commit unless the user explicitly asks
- Do not create markdown docs the user did not request (except memory bank files above)

## Build & test

Always build with the fast build script. It configures + incrementally builds the
**single** `build/` dir (Ninja, RelWithDebInfo, QML cachegen off). There is no
`build-dev/` — do not recreate it.

```bash
./build-fast                      # configure (first run) + incremental build -> build/bin/BrockDJ
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```

Run the app: `./build/bin/BrockDJ`

## Key files

- Bootstrap: `src/app/ApplicationBootstrap.cpp`
- Mixer UI: `src/qml/MixerSection.qml`, `src/qml/CrossfaderBar.qml`
- Mixer C++: `src/app/MixerControl.cpp`
- Engine DSP: `src/engine/audio/MixerDspSource.cpp`
